---
layout: layouts/base.njk
extraCss: persona-detail
title: Eli - ADHD Coach
description: Eli understands the ADHD brain. From managing hyperfocus to building sustainable routines, Eli offers strategies that actually work with how your mind operates.
personaColor: "#6B5B95"
personaSecondary: "#4A4063"
---

{% from "partials/icons.njk" import play, plus, check %}
{% from "partials/pricing.njk" import priced, priceBadge with context %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="persona-detail-hero" style="--persona-color: #6B5B95; --persona-secondary: #4A4063;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="persona-detail-content">
      <div class="persona-detail-avatar">
        {# LUXO STYLE: Opaque white ellipse eyes, NO pupils, NO mouth #}
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="100%" height="100%">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="eliDetailGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color: #6B5B95"/>
              <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color: #4A4063"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="url(#eliDetailGrad)"/>
          <ellipse cx="36" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
          <ellipse cx="64" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="persona-detail-info">
        <h1>Eli</h1>
        <p class="persona-detail-tagline">ADHD Coach</p>
        <div class="persona-detail-meta">
          <span>by Ferni</span>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-detail-actions">
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-add-team btn-lg">
            {{ plus(20) }}
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $9.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
          <button class="btn btn-preview-voice">
            {{ play(20) }}
            Preview Voice
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Content -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="persona-detail-layout">
      
      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Description -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">About Eli</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);">
            Eli understands the ADHD brain. From managing hyperfocus to building sustainable routines, 
            Eli offers strategies that actually work with how your mind operates—not against it.
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            Unlike generic productivity tips, Eli knows that ADHD brains need different approaches. 
            Whether you're struggling with time blindness, emotional dysregulation, or the classic 
            "I know what to do but can't make myself do it" problem—Eli gets it.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- What Eli Helps With -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">What I Help With</h2>
          <div class="persona-help-grid">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Time Management</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Body doubling, time blocking, and breaking down overwhelming tasks
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Task Prioritization</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Figuring out what actually matters when everything feels urgent
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Emotional Regulation</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Managing rejection sensitivity and emotional overwhelm
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Building Habits</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Creating systems that stick, even when motivation fades
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Voice Sample -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Voice Sample</h2>
          <div class="voice-player">
            <button class="voice-play-btn">
              {{ play(24) }}
            </button>
            <div class="voice-waveform">
              <svg width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 200 40">
                <path d="M0 20 Q10 5 20 20 Q30 35 40 20 Q50 5 60 20 Q70 35 80 20 Q90 5 100 20 Q110 35 120 20 Q130 5 140 20 Q150 35 160 20 Q170 5 180 20 Q190 35 200 20" 
                      stroke="#6B5B95" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="voice-duration">0:24</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-3); font-style: italic;">
            "Hey, I totally get it. Starting a new system is exciting but... you know how it goes. 
            What if we tried something smaller? Just one tiny thing you can do right now, 
            before the motivation fades?"
          </p>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Personality Traits -->
        <div class="trait-radar" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 class="trait-radar-title">Personality Profile</h3>
          <div class="trait-list">
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #6B5B95;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Warmth</span>
              <span class="trait-value">85%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #4A4063;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Patience</span>
              <span class="trait-value">95%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #7B6BA8;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Energy</span>
              <span class="trait-value">70%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #8B7BB8;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Structure</span>
              <span class="trait-value">80%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #5B4B85;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Humor</span>
              <span class="trait-value">60%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Tags -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Tags</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <span class="persona-tag">ADHD</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Focus</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Executive Function</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Routines</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Productivity</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Time Blindness</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Publisher -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Publisher</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3);">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: 700;">F</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight: 600;">Ferni</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="persona-cta-card" style="--cta-from: #6B5B95; --cta-to: #4A4063;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: white;">Ready to get started?</h3>
          <p>
            {{ priced('Start your free trial today', 'Free to add to your team') }}
          </p>
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn persona-cta-btn">
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $9.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Related Personas -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>You Might Also Like</h2>
      <p>Similar personas that could help you</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="persona-grid" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <a href="/pages/persona/kenji/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #2C3E50; --persona-secondary: #1A252F;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">K</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Kenji</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Sleep Guide</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Reclaim your nights with evidence-based sleep coaching and relaxation techniques.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('Free+') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      <a href="/pages/persona/amara/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #7B6BA8; --persona-secondary: #5A4D80;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">A</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Amara</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Chronic Illness Ally</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Living with chronic illness is more than symptoms—Amara is here for all of it.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('$9.99/mo') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      <a href="/pages/persona/sasha/" class="persona-card persona-tone-light" style="--persona-color: #E07B53; --persona-secondary: #B85C3C;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">S</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Sasha</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Creative Catalyst</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Spark creativity and battle creative block with energy and fresh ideas.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('Free+') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
